                                 <div class="card-body">
                                    					
                                    <h2 class="card-title">Prospective Students</h2>
                                    					
                                    <p class="card-text">Consider a career in mechanical engineering and explore our program options</p>
                                    					<a href="/mechanical/prospective-students.html" class="btn btn-default">Prospective Students</a>
                                    				</div>
                                 			</div>
                              		</div>
                           	</div>
                         
                        </p>
                     
                     <h2>Department Mission</h2>
                     
                     <p>The mission of the Department of Mechanical Engineering is to:&nbsp;</p>
                     
                     <p><em><span>"provide a broad-based, practice-oriented Mechanical Engineering education that enables
                              graduates to become technically-proficient and professional leaders through innovative,
                              entrepreneurial, multi-interdisciplinary engagement in the community and lifelong
                              learning."</span></em></p>
                     
                     <hr>
                     
